This software implements statistical methods described in:

  Cupać, J., Louter, C., Nikolov, G., Schuster, M., Datsiou, K. C. (2025).
  Open GLASSlab – Interactive Strength Analysis Handbook. TU Delft.
  https://oit.tudelft.nl/open-GLASSlab/
  Licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  The methods (2P Weibull with least squares, weighted least squares and the
  EN 12603 GLUE estimator; confidence bands; fractiles) were implemented
  independently from these descriptions. No code or text was copied.
  This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by TU Delft or the
  handbook's authors; "TU Delft Methode 1" in the interface only names the
  method setting it reproduces.

  EN 12603: Glass in building – Procedures for goodness of fit and confidence
  intervals for Weibull distributed glass strength data. Cited; the κn
  coefficients are the published table values.

